{"id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tmcomp.md","title":"配置、单步计算与输出","display":"df-tmcomp — 配置、单步计算与输出","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tmcomp","aliases":["20-df-tmcomp"],"display":"df-tmcomp — 配置、单步计算与输出","chapter":"1","section":"1.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 1.4.2–1.4.3；本地配置关系展开","source_pdf_pages":[44,45],"source_printed_pages":[8,9],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tm]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tmcomp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tmcomp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tmcomp — 配置、单步计算与输出"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 1.4.2–1.4.3；本地配置关系展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>44</span><span>45</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>9</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"514101784b6fa26f\" href=\"?note=514101784b6fa26f\" title=\"20-df-tm\">20-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(k,n,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,c&#39;\">\\(c,c&#39;\\)</span> 是配置候选，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,q&#39;\\in Q\">\\(q,q&#39;\\in Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,t&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\">\\(t,t&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\)</span>。所有停止历史在下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span> 内取值。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"514101784b6fa26f\" href=\"?note=514101784b6fa26f\" title=\"20-df-tm\">20-df-tm</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tmcomp}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Tape}_S:=\\{t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:t(i)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=Q\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(q,t,h),(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\land\n\\exists b\\in S\\ \\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\\n[((q,t(h)),(q&#39;,b,d))\\in\\delta\\land h&#39;=h+d\\land t&#39;(h)=b\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\ (i\\ne h\\Rightarrow t&#39;(i)=t(i))],\\\\\nt_x(i):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;0\\le i\\le x,\\\\\\sqcup&amp;i&lt;0\\lor i&gt;x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb Z),\\qquad c_0(x):=(1,t_x,0),\\\\\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ [c(i)\\to_M c(i+1)])\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tmcomp}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Tape}_S:=\\{t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:t(i)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=Q\\times\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(q,t,h),(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\land\n\\exists b\\in S\\ \\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\\n[((q,t(h)),(q&#39;,b,d))\\in\\delta\\land h&#39;=h+d\\land t&#39;(h)=b\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\ (i\\ne h\\Rightarrow t&#39;(i)=t(i))],\\\\\nt_x(i):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;0\\le i\\le x,\\\\\\sqcup&amp;i&lt;0\\lor i&gt;x,\\end{cases}\n\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb Z),\\qquad c_0(x):=(1,t_x,0),\\\\\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ [c(i)\\to_M c(i+1)])\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nb_i(\\vec x):=\\sum_{j&lt;i}(x_j+2)\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\nt_{\\vec x}(z):=\\begin{cases}\n1&amp;\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\\\\n\\sqcup&amp;\\neg\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i]\n\\end{cases}\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb Z),\\\\\nc_0^{(k)}(\\vec x):=(1,t_{\\vec x},0),\\\\\nM^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ [c(i)\\to_M c(i+1)])\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\nM(\\vec x)\\simeq M^{(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad c_0^{(1)}((x))=c_0(x).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nb_i(\\vec x):=\\sum_{j&lt;i}(x_j+2)\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\nt_{\\vec x}(z):=\\begin{cases}\n1&amp;\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\\\\n\\sqcup&amp;\\neg\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i]\n\\end{cases}\\quad(z\\in\\mathbb Z),\\\\\nc_0^{(k)}(\\vec x):=(1,t_{\\vec x},0),\\\\\nM^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ [c(i)\\to_M c(i+1)])\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\nM(\\vec x)\\simeq M^{(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad c_0^{(1)}((x))=c_0(x).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>转移关系和停止关系均显式限制在合法配置内；访问部分转移表改用图成员关系，不预设该格已有转移。确定性与停止状态无后继保证输出唯一。</p>\n<p>保留原输入规则：第 i 个输入用 x_i+1 个连续的 1 表示，相邻块之间一个空白；零元输入是全空白磁带。正常停止输出仍为整条磁带上 1 的总数，既不减一，也不要求头停在 1 上。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 1.4.2–1.4.3；本地配置关系展开；印刷页 8, 9；PDF 第 44, 45 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"514101784b6fa26f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"514101784b6fa26f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnc