\quad(z\\in\\mathbb Z),\\\\\nc_0^{(k)}(\\vec x):=(1,t_{\\vec x},0),\\\\\nM^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\\n\\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\land(\\forall i<n\\ [c(i)\\to_M c(i+1)])\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\nM(\\vec x)\\simeq M^{(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad c_0^{(1)}((x))=c_0(x).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2968,"backlinks":[{"id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-machine]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。"},{"id":"1b27c625bb944c27","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。"},{"id":"d11732572066c4e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"226855fedac0ee1c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"新增直接依赖：[[20-df-characteristic]]；[[20-df-pairing]]；[[20-df-tmcomp]]"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count